@startuml
state Off(Initial)
state AlarmActivated
state Ringing(Final states: Ringing, Stopped)
state NextAlarm

AlarmActivated -user sets an alarm time-> Off: SetAlarmTime
Off -current time matches set alarm time-> Ringing: AlarmMatchesTime
Ringing -user stops the ringing alarm-> Stopped
Stopped -next scheduled alarm time is reached-> Ringing
Ringing -user attempts to turn off the alarm (ambiguous behavior not specified)-> AlarmActivated

@enduml
